        "content": "### Open traces in Jaeger\n\nThe embedded Grafana trace panel is intentionally disabled in this setup because it is less reliable than querying Jaeger directly during the demo.\n\nUse Jaeger UI instead:\n- URL: http://localhost:16686\n- Service: `nopcommerce`\n- Operation: `admin.product.create`\n\nExpected child spans:\n- `catalog.product.insert`\n- `catalog.cache.invalidation`\n\nIf the operation dropdown is empty, run the load test first and refresh Jaeger.",
